      "created_at": "2014-08-21T05:55:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sorry, I wasn't very clear there at all. I didn't mean factoring in all the elevation changes along the way, I meant counting the hexes as if you were moving ignoring range. Like moving one space puts you at range 1, assuming the elevation hasn't changed.</p><p>I'm getting it right, but I worded my explanation very badly.</p>",
