      "created_at": "2014-08-21T16:00:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And you don’t necessarily count ALL the elevation changes for range; if you’re 2 hexes away from each other, you’re both at elevation 2, and there’s a 1 in between, then you are still at range 2; only the final elevation difference actually matters.</p>",
